1
00:00:00,514 --> 00:00:03,384
(Amy:)Professor Tupperman is dead
and that makes us?

2
00:00:03,617 --> 00:00:05,317
(Sheldon:)Sad.

3
00:00:06,086 --> 00:00:10,576
(Amy:)The fact that there are so many people here
doesn't make us cranky and claustrophobic.

4
00:00:10,791 --> 00:00:13,591
(Amy:)- It makes us?
- Glad.

5
00:00:14,795 --> 00:00:17,325
(Amy:)Giving Mrs. Davis the box set
of Roots was?

6
00:00:17,531 --> 00:00:19,661
(Penny:)Bad.

7
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,530
(Sheldon:)- However...
- No.

8
00:00:21,735 --> 00:00:23,105
(Sheldon:)Fine, bad.

9
00:00:24,538 --> 00:00:26,408
(Raj:)Unbelievable.

10
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:29,870
(Raj:)You have some nerve showing up
just to schmooze the tenure committee.

11
00:00:30,110 --> 00:00:31,130
(Sheldon:)You're here.

12
00:00:31,345 --> 00:00:34,315
(Raj:)Excuse me, I'm here to pay my respects
to Professor Tupperware...

13
00:00:34,481 --> 00:00:35,911
(Raj:)...or whatever his name is.

14
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:40,750
(Sheldon:)So am I. His passing makes me feel bad.

15
00:00:43,557 --> 00:00:46,527
(Leonard:)Well, well, well, Sheldon,
fancy meeting you here.

16
00:00:46,727 --> 00:00:50,387
(Leonard:)I guess the train store in Glendale
wasn't having a cotillion after all.

17
00:00:51,832 --> 00:00:54,232
(Raj:)And you.
You said you weren't coming here either.

18
00:00:54,435 --> 00:00:56,995
(Raj:)I have a thick accent.
You don't know what I said.

19
00:00:58,172 --> 00:01:02,732
- I'd like to know why Penny's here.
- I'm here to support my man, just like you.

